<title>FRANCE: PRESS DIGEST - Algeria - Jan 20.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Algeria - Jan 20.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the leading stories in the Algerian press on Monday. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>EL MOUDJAHID</p>
<p>- Another car bomb slaughter in Algiers: twenty-one people killed and 60 wounded.</p>
<p>EL WATAN</p>
<p>- Slaughter in Belouizdad in Algiers.</p>
<p>- Steel maker Sider firm will lay off hundreds of workers.</p>
<p>AL KHABAR</p>
<p>- Car bomb kills 23 in Algiers.</p>
<p>LIBERTE</p>
<p>- Ramadan massacres: 48 people slaughtered in Sidi Abdelaziz village and 21 others killed in a car bomb in Belouizdad in Algiers.</p>
</text>
